# Every text file is stored AND checked out with LF, on every OS.
# Without this, Git for Windows (autocrlf=true by default) checks files out
# with CRLF: bash scripts die with `$'\r': command not found`, and anything
# that splits a note on "\n" keeps a stray "\r" at the end of each line.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
